1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,236
Before the event: planning docs, agent skills and my open-source MME harness.

2
00:00:06,286 --> 00:00:10,950
Everything you'll see in Maqet was built this week.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,007
Four million people in Argentina build their homes with their own hands, in stages, as they save.

4
00:00:18,057 --> 00:00:26,724
An architect or a designer from day one is rarely within reach, and a mistake is paid for with their savings.

5
00:00:26,774 --> 00:00:32,950
Picture Rosa: she wants to add a bedroom, and all she has is this drawing.

6
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:41,950
Maqet turns that drawing into a measured project: how it looks, what to buy at each stage, and a drawing for the professional.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,584
A technician visits with a phone.

8
00:00:44,634 --> 00:00:52,048
First Meta model: Muse Spark reads the drawing and the written measurements, for less than a cent.

9
00:00:52,098 --> 00:00:57,316
Each wall takes its own length, and what is estimated says so.

10
00:00:57,366 --> 00:00:59,950
The AI proposes, a person decides.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,126
Add a three-by-four bedroom for my daughter, on the north side.

12
00:01:05,176 --> 00:01:07,950
Rosa asks with her own voice.

13
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:22,068
Muse Voice Transcribe hears her, and Muse Wonder edits the home, but it doesn't draw: it only uses validated tools, and every change goes through construction rules written in code.

14
00:01:22,118 --> 00:01:24,421
And add a second floor.

15
00:01:24,471 --> 00:01:25,362
Undo that.

16
00:01:25,412 --> 00:01:29,597
And when something needs a professional, it says so.

17
00:01:29,647 --> 00:01:31,950
Maqet never certifies a structure.

18
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:40,950
Muse Image shows how the room could look, starting from the measured geometry, not from the model's imagination.

19
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:46,950
And in augmented reality, she sees her extension on her own table.

20
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:51,205
And now what no image app gives you.

21
00:01:51,255 --> 00:01:58,652
A material list by stage, to buy as she saves: bricks, cement, sand, steel.

22
00:01:58,702 --> 00:02:06,631
And a DXF with real measurements, for the professional who will review and sign it.

23
00:02:06,681 --> 00:02:11,950
No model writes these numbers: they come from deterministic code.

24
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:18,825
Four Meta models, each in its place: Spark reads, Voice listens, Wonder edits, Image shows.

25
00:02:18,875 --> 00:02:30,283
And none of them is in charge: one measured scene is the source of truth, and 3D, AR, materials and DXF all derive from it.

26
00:02:30,333 --> 00:02:33,950
More than 1,500 automated tests, all open source.

27
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,774
Everything is preliminary, and says so.

28
00:02:36,824 --> 00:02:46,185
Maqet doesn't replace the architect: it gives people who could never afford one a first measured project, from day one.

29
00:02:46,235 --> 00:02:49,950
Next: validating it with builders and housing programs.
